        "It sits between zero and one, fit not causality",
        "Zero conditional mean keeps beta unbiased",
        "If it fails, omitted variable bias"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Chorus",
      "lines": [
        "Minimize the sum of squared residuals",
        "Pick beta zero hat, beta one hat",
        "Smallest squares is what OLS does",
        "Smallest squares, and that is that"
      ]
